<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "top" align = "left">
<ptxt>
<emph>
P0139: O2 Sensor Circuit Slow Response (Bank1 Sensor2)
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Signal response time from rich to lean is longer than specified time.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(3 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" morerows = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "top" align = "left">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
HO2S and/or its circuit
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Exhaust system
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Air intake system
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Fuel system
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Engine compression
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Ignition system
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Emission control system
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ECM
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "top" align = "left">
<ptxt>
<emph>
P2270: O2 Sensor Signal Biased / Stuck Lean (Bank1 Sensor2)
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
HO2S signal stays in lean state for specified time even during A/F enrichment control.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(3 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "top" align = "left">
<ptxt>
<emph>
P2271: O2 Sensor Signal Biased / Stuck Rich (Bank1 Sensor2)
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
HO2S signal stays in rich state for specified time even during A/F enleanment control.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(3 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</servinfosub>
